@startuml
[*] --> IdleState

IdleState --> SettingPrices : User starts setting prices
IdleState --> TrackingPrices : User wants to track prices
IdleState --> DisplayingPrices : System displays prices to customers

SettingPrices --> AdjustingPrices : User adjusts prices based on factors
SettingPrices --> DisplayingPrices : Prices are ready to display
SettingPrices --> IdleState : User finishes setting prices

AdjustingPrices --> ReceivingRecommendations : System provides price recommendations
AdjustingPrices --> DisplayingPrices : Updated prices are displayed
AdjustingPrices --> IdleState : Price adjustment complete

TrackingPrices --> DisplayingPrices : User views price comparisons
TrackingPrices --> IdleState : User finishes tracking prices

ReceivingRecommendations --> AdjustingPrices : User implements recommendations
ReceivingRecommendations --> IdleState : User reviews recommendations

DisplayingPrices --> [*] : Prices displayed to customers
DisplayingPrices --> IdleState : Display process completes

[*] <-- IdleState
@enduml
